	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES:\nDET_A,B = Card detect switch pins. Behaviour:\n - open circuit when no card\n - short circuit when card (pulled low)\n\nThe GPIO must have an internal resistor (~47k).\nGPIO = HIGH = No card\nGPIO = LOW = Card"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 27.305 0)
		(size 65.405 27.94)
		(margins 1.8 1.8 1.8 1.8)
		(stroke
			(width 0.6)
			(type solid)
			(color 132 132 132 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 2 2)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5eaa79bd-bac1-4f31-b5a6-7c85200ca566")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES:\nPull up internally the GPIOs for the \n - CMD\n - D[0,1,2,3]\n\nDo not pull up CLK. Leave unpulled in cubeIDE\n\nThe pins need a pull up resistor of about 10k-100k, the internal pull-ups provide around 40-50k. 47k is a typical value for external pull-ups. -> pullup in cubeIDE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 57.785 0)
		(size 65.405 38.735)
		(margins 1.8 1.8 1.8 1.8)
		(stroke
			(width 0.6)
			(type solid)
			(color 132 132 132 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 2 2)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "655afa49-f9f4-4d6f-9bfc-54a25da7d42c")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES:\nAdd 33Ohme resistors in serie to every logic line, So CMD, D[0,1,2,3] and CLK\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
